--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- V3__seed_firm3.sql
--
-- Seed data for FIRM_CD=3 ("CF Inc") — same approach as V2 (firm 1), adapted to
-- firm 3's actual shape. Firm 3 is a small INSTITUTIONAL firm: no households and
-- no CAGs; its accounts are owned directly by companies (entity type 2) and one
-- individual (type 1), and they carry no current positions. So this seed covers
-- the advisor + the firm's clients + accounts (the holdings tables stay empty,
-- mirroring prod).
--
-- Provenance : extracted from PROD (192.168.1.42 / ORCL12VM, schema GP), then
--              PII-SCRUBBED for this public repo (IDs/codes/relationships real;
--              names, company names, emails, password hash synthetic/blanked).
-- Generated  : 2026-06-01. Applies on top of V1 (baseline) and V2 (firm 1).
--
-- Scope (<=10 rows per table): 1 firm, 9 entities (advisor tim3 + 7 companies +
-- 1 individual), 8 accounts (+account_details), 8 entity-account owner roles,
-- 8 policy grants.
--
-- LOGIN (tim3 / gwAdmin): the advisor entity is LDAP_UID='tim3', GW_ADMIN_FLAG=1
-- (gwAdmin), MFA off, active. Password is NOT committed (LDAP_PSWD_HASH blanked);
-- SAML-broker login works via the email auto-link (tim3@geowealth.int — adjust to
-- match the P1 user). gwAdmin is the master visibility switch; the seeded
-- POLICY_RULE grants are this advisor's real permission rows.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------


-- ===== FIRM (firm 3) =====

-- ===== ENTITIES (advisor->tim3, 7 companies, 1 individual) =====

-- ===== USER_DETAIL (advisor, individual) =====

-- ===== COMPANY_DETAIL (7 company clients) =====

-- ===== ENTITY_EMAIL =====

-- ===== ACCOUNT_DETAILS (FK parent of NF_ACCOUNT) =====

-- ===== NF_ACCOUNT (8 accounts) =====

-- ===== ENTITY_ACCOUNT_ROLE (owner=1 links) =====

-- ===== POLICY_RULE (advisor grants) =====

-- ===== Make the advisor a login-able firm-3 gwAdmin (tim3) =====
UPDATE ENTITY_TBL SET GW_ADMIN_FLAG=1, MFA_REQUIRED_FLAG=0, ENTITY_ACTIVE_FLAG=1,
       LOGIN_INACTIVATED_FLAG=0, LDAP_PSWD_HASH=NULL, LINKED_GW_USER=NULL
 WHERE ENTITY_ID='019E1AE7C9D0738687919D666E4DDE4C';
UPDATE ENTITY_EMAIL_TBL SET EMAIL='tim3@geowealth.int', PRIMARY_EMAIL_FLAG=1
 WHERE ENTITY_ID='019E1AE7C9D0738687919D666E4DDE4C';
COMMIT;
